<title>PORTUGAL: Portuqal's Tranquilidade boosts premiums.</title>
<headline>Portuqal's Tranquilidade boosts premiums.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Companhia de Seguros Tranquilidade said it boosted premium income over the first half of 1997 to 66 billion escudos, 5.6 percent up on the same period last year.</p>
<p>Tranquilidade Vida continued to lead the market in life insurance policies, with volume of 39 billion escudos, even if growth was slower than over the same period last year.</p>
<p>The non-life sector grew 9.9 percent.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113121</p>
</text>
